Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:30:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07675/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5829 v3: persistent
 reflection memory (Reki/forge's mechanism)

Operator chose to add the winners' remaining key mechanism. v3: the
model periodically (every N actions) REWRITES a persistent NL notes
doc (RULES/GOAL/PROGRESS/AVOID) from its accumulated play, re-injected
as LEARNED NOTES into every decision -- Reki/forge's reflection memory
that survives context eviction and accumulates a self-authored model
of the game. Primed with "RULES:" so gemma writes notes directly;
keeps prior notes on a failed reflection; capped at 1200 chars.
--reflect N on the driver; final_notes surfaced in the result. 3 new
tests (22 total, mypy clean).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
